config FINGERPRINT_XIAOMI_FP
	tristate "Xiaomi fingerprint hub"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT
	help
	  Small Xiaomi fingerprint hub driver.  It exposes the "fingerdown"
	  sysfs attribute used by the vendor fingerprint HAL on Xiaomi
	  devices such as marble (POCO F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.  The module will
	  be called xiaomifp.
